				<u>Pol.</u>
				1315b2
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τῶν σίτων</span> (leg.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσσίτων</span>) <i>moderation in
			(of</i>) . . , <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.2.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. περί τι, ἔν τινι</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				411e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				412b
			</span></i>: pl., <i>middle course</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> the 
			<i>right amount</i> or <i>degree</i> of anything, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fract.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Liq.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>middle condition, modest circumstances</i> or <i>ability,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1121.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				305.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>graceful proportions, elegance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1309b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				204
			</span></i><i>b.</i></div>
